CFG_ADV_INTERVAL_MAX_HEXA|CFG_ADV_INTERVAL_MAX_HEXA|Advertising configuration||0x00|0xA0|Shall be &lt 100ms
CFG_ADV_BD_ADDRESS|CFG_ADV_BD_ADDRESS|Application parameters||0x000000000000|0xFFFFFFFFFFFF|ex: 0x7257acd87a6c
CFG_IDENTITY_ADDRESS|CFG_IDENTITY_ADDRESS|Advertising configuration||||
