SERVICE5_CHAR4_VALUE_OFFSET|Update char value offset|||0|=(SERVICE5_CHAR4_VALUE_LENGTH-1)|The offset from which the attribute value has to be updated. Only active when CHAR_PROP_NOTIFY or CHAR_PROP_INDICATE is selected. Used in custom_stm.c aci_gatt_update_char_value function
SERVICE5_CHAR5_VALUE_OFFSET|Update char value offset|||0|=(SERVICE5_CHAR5_VALUE_LENGTH-1)|The offset from which the attribute value has to be updated. Only active when CHAR_PROP_NOTIFY or CHAR_PROP_INDICATE is selected. Used in custom_stm.c aci_gatt_update_char_value function
SERVICE_CHAR_ATTR_PERMISSION_NONE|ATTR_PERMISSION_NONE|||||No security
SERVICE_CHAR_ATTR_PERMISSION_AUTHEN_READ|ATTR_PERMISSION_AUTHEN_READ|||||Need authentication to read
SERVICE_CHAR_ATTR_PERMISSION_AUTHOR_READ|ATTR_PERMISSION_AUTHOR_READ|||||Need authorization to read
SERVICE_CHAR_ATTR_PERMISSION_ENCRY_READ|ATTR_PERMISSION_ENCRY_READ|||||Link must be encrypted to read
SERVICE_CHAR_ATTR_PERMISSION_AUTHEN_WRITE|ATTR_PERMISSION_AUTHEN_WRITE|||||Need authentication to write
SERVICE_CHAR_ATTR_PERMISSION_AUTHOR_WRITE|ATTR_PERMISSION_AUTHOR_WRITE|||||Need authorization to write
SERVICE_CHAR_ATTR_PERMISSION_ENCRY_WRITE|ATTR_PERMISSION_ENCRY_WRITE|||||Link must be encrypted to write
SERVICE_CHAR_GATT_DONT_NOTIFY_EVENTS|GATT_DONT_NOTIFY_EVENTS|||||Do not notify events
SERVICE_CHAR_GATT_NOTIFY_ATTRIBUTE_WRITE|GATT_NOTIFY_ATTRIBUTE_WRITE|||||The application will be notified when a client writes to this attribute. An @ref EVT_BLUE_GATT_ATTRIBUTE_MODIFIED will be issued.
SERVICE_CHAR_GATT_NOTIFY_WRITE_REQ_AND_WAIT_FOR_APPL_RESP|GATT_NOTIFY_WRITE_REQ_AND_WAIT_FOR_APPL_RESP|||||The application will be notified when a write request, a write cmd or a signed write cmd is received by the server for this attribute. An @ref EVT_BLUE_GATT_WRITE_PERMIT_REQ will be issued.
SERVICE_CHAR_GATT_NOTIFY_READ_REQ_AND_WAIT_FOR_APPL_RESP|GATT_NOTIFY_READ_REQ_AND_WAIT_FOR_APPL_RESP|||||The application will be notified when a read request of any type is received for this attribute. An @ref EVT_BLUE_GATT_READ_PERMIT_REQ will be issued.
SERVICE_CHAR_GATT_NOTIFY_NOTIFICATION_COMPLETION|GATT_NOTIFY_NOTIFICATION_COMPLETION|||||The application will be notified when notifications are transmitted. An ACI_GATT_NOTIFICATION_COMPLETE_EVENT will be issued.
SERVICE_CHAR_NB_DESCRIPTOR|Service number of descriptor(s)|||||Value depends of the number of characteristics with the property Notify or Indicate
SERVICE1_MAX_ATTRIBUTES_RECORDS|Service max attributes record(s)|Service1||||Value depends of the number of characteristics (nbOfChar) with the property Notify or Indicate(nbOfDescriptor) Max_Attributes_Records = 1 + 2*nbOfChar + nbOfDescriptor
SERVICE2_MAX_ATTRIBUTES_RECORDS|Service max attributes record(s)|Service2||||Value depends of the number of characteristics (nbOfChar) with the property Notify or Indicate(nbOfDescriptor) Max_Attributes_Records = 1 + 2*nbOfChar + nbOfDescriptor
SERVICE3_MAX_ATTRIBUTES_RECORDS|Service max attributes record(s)|Service3||||Value depends of the number of characteristics (nbOfChar) with the property Notify or Indicate(nbOfDescriptor) Max_Attributes_Records = 1 + 2*nbOfChar + nbOfDescriptor
SERVICE4_MAX_ATTRIBUTES_RECORDS|Service max attributes record(s)|Service4||||Value depends of the number of characteristics (nbOfChar) with the property Notify or Indicate(nbOfDescriptor) Max_Attributes_Records = 1 + 2*nbOfChar + nbOfDescriptor
SERVICE5_MAX_ATTRIBUTES_RECORDS|Service max attributes record(s)|Service5||||Value depends of the number of characteristics (nbOfChar) with the property Notify or Indicate(nbOfDescriptor) Max_Attributes_Records = 1 + 2*nbOfChar + nbOfDescriptor
SERVICE_CHAR_ENC_KEY_SIZE|Encryption Key Size|||0x07|0x10|
SERVICE_CHAR_LENGTH_CHARACTERISTIC|Length characteristic|||||Type of characteristic length in ble_defs.h. can be either CHAR_VALUE_LEN_CONSTANT(0x00) or CHAR_VALUE_LEN_VARIABLE(0x01)
